[0.044, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[H\u001b[J\u001b[38;5;174m \u2590\u001b[48;5;16m\u259b\u2588\u2588\u2588\u259c\u001b[49m\u258c\u001b[1;12H\u001b[39m\u001b[1mClaude\u001b[CCode\u001b[C\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;241mv2.1.109\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;174m\u259d\u259c\u001b[48;5;16m\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u001b[49m\u259b\u2598\u001b[2;12H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;241mOpus\u001b[C4.6\u001b[Cwith\u001b[Chigh\u001b[Ceffort\u001b[C\u00b7\u001b[CClaude\u001b[CPro\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;174m \u001b[C\u2598\u2598\u001b[C\u259d\u259d\u001b[3;12H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;241m~/src/receipt-scanner-demo\u001b[5;1H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;16m\u23fa\u001b[C\u001b[39mDone,\u001b[Call\u001b[Ccleared.\u001b[7;3H\u001b[38;5;241mWrote\u001b[C\u001b[1m2\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;241m memories\u001b[C(ctrl+o\u001b[Cto\u001b[Cexpand)\u001b[9;1H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;248m\u001b[48;5;255m\u276f \u001b[38;5;16mThanks. OK I want to understand the plan for ReceiptUpdates. Is the idea that when we present a receipt to the user, we will sort\u001b[39m \u001b[10;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m of compose the original receipt with all its updates? Or is ReceiptUpdate just a parameter type for the diff, which we apply and\u001b[39m \u001b[11;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m then save a full receipt back to the database?\u001b[39m                                                                                   \u001b[12;1H              \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?2026l\u001b[48;5;255m      "]
[0.001, "o", "                                                                                                                \u001b[13;1H  \u001b[38;5;16mThe idea of tracking incremental (undoable?) updates is actually nice, but I want to grok the plan ehre.\u001b[39m                          \u001b[15;1H\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;16m\u23fa\u001b[C\u001b[39mIt's\u001b[Cthe\u001b[Csimpler\u001b[Cversion\u001b[C\u2014\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;105mReceiptUpdate\u001b[C\u001b[39mis\u001b[Cjust\u001b[Cthe\u001b[Cparameter\u001b[Ctype\u001b[Cfor\u001b[Cthe\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;105mPUT\u001b[C\u001b[39mendpoint.\u001b[CIt\u001b[Cdescribes\u001b[C\"what\u001b[Cfields\u001b[Care\u001b[Cyou\u001b[16;3Hchanging\u001b[Cin\u001b[Cthis\u001b[Crequest.\"\u001b[CThe\u001b[Cfunction\u001b[Capplies\u001b[Cthose\u001b[Cchanges\u001b[Cdirectly\u001b[Cto\u001b[Cthe\u001b[CDB\u001b[Crows\u001b[Cand\u001b[Cthat's\u001b[Cit.\u001b[CNo\u001b[Chistory,\u001b[Cno\u001b[Cundo,\u001b[Cno\u001b[17;3Hcomposition.\u001b[CAfter\u001b[Cthe\u001b[Cupdate,\u001b[Cthe\u001b[CDB\u001b[Cjust\u001b[Chas\u001b[Cthe\u001b[Cnew\u001b[Cvalues.\u001b[19;3HSo\u001b[Cthe\u001b[Cflow\u001b[Cis:\u001b[20;3H1.\u001b[CUser\u001b[Csees\u001b[Creceipt\u001b[Cdetail\u001b[Cpage\u001b[Cwith\u001b[Ccurrent\u001b[Cvalues\u001b[Cfrom\u001b[CDB\u001b[21;3H2.\u001b[CUser\u001b[Cedits\u001b[Csome\u001b[Cfields\u001b[C(e.g.\u001b[Cfixes\u001b[Cthe\u001b[Cstore\u001b[Cname,\u001b[Cadjusts\u001b[Can\u001b[Citem\u001b[Cprice)\u001b[22;3H3.\u001b[CFrontend\u001b[Csends\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;105m"]
