[0.004, "o", "\u001b[23;1H\u001b[38;5;248m\u001b[48;5;255m\u276f \u001b[38;5;16mAlright let's get to work on the front-end flow.\u001b[39m                                                                                  \u001b[24;1H                                                                                                                                    \u001b[25;1H  \u001b[38;5;16mHere's what I'm thinking:\u001b[39m                                                                                                         \u001b[26;1H                                                                                                                                    \u001b[27;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m- A dashboard page where the user sees their receipts and some kind of summary; maybe just put the list now\u001b[39m                       \u001b[28;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m- There's a dotted-line box for drag-dropping or click-to-upload above the list\u001b[39m                                                   \u001b[29;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m- When the user uploads, it takes them to a page where they see the receipt image th\u001b(B"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;16m\u001b[48;5;255mey uploaded (kept around in the browser) next\u001b[39m \u001b[30;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m to the scan results. The scan results should be easily editable: each cost a textbox, each name a textbox, etc.\u001b[39m                  \u001b[31;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m- Edits should autosave a lot, probably on each change of focus, and have clear \u201csaved\u201d indicators, maybe a border around each \u001b[39m   \u001b[32;1H  \u001b[38;5;16mbox\u001b[39m                                                                                                                               \u001b[33;3H\u001b[49m    \r\n\u001b[38;5;174m\u2722\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;174mFlamb\u00e9ing\u2026 \u001b[39m                                                                                                                       \u001b[35;3H            \r\n\u001b[38;5;246m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
