[0.0, "o", "\u001b[48;5;255m \u001b[38;5;16mYeah. I am not too concerned about testing the db layer yet (I mean we can unit test it but it's not too thrilling; maybe if we \u001b[39m  \u001b[31;1H  \u001b[38;5;16mget into complex receipt-diffing or something). So let's write a test at the API level that focuses on adding a receipt with raw \u001b[39m \u001b[32;1H  \u001b[38;5;16mdata and fetching it back. Then we aren't also trying to test all the fuzzy matching\u001b[39m                                              \u001b[49m\u001b[33;1H\u001b[K\u001b[34;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;241mRead\u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;241m\u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;241m file\u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;241m(ctrl+o\u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;241mto\u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;241mexpand)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;16m\u23fa\u001b[39m\r\u001b[2S\u001b[34;3HFirst,\u001b[Cadd\u001b[Cthe\u001b[Cnew\u001b[Cendpoint,\u001b[Cthen\u001b[Cwrite\u001b[Cthe\u001b[Ctest.\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;65m\u23fa\u001b[39m\u001b[36;132H\n\u001b[35;3H\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b(B\u001b[m(\u001b]8;id=tmux4;file:///Users/joe/src/receipt-scanner-demo/src/server/server.ts\u001b\\src/server/server.ts\u001b]8;;\u001b\\)\r\n\u001b[38;5;241m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;241m\u23bf\u001b[C\u00a0\u001b[39m\u001b[36;132H\n\u001b[35;6HAdded\u001b[C\u001b[1m7\u001b[C\u001b(B\u001b[mlines\r\n\u001b[K\u001b"]
